# Forklift ignore file: rules only forklift follows. Forklift reads every .gitignore, so the
# repository's .gitignore already keeps target/, .idea/, .claude/, .dev/, OpenTofu state and
# .DS_Store out; .git is always ignored and .forklift needs no rule.
#
# Lines are gitignore lines, read after every .gitignore and stronger than them. A line starting
# re: is a regex matched against the whole /-separated path, and !re: re-includes:
#   target-*/
#   re:docs/generated/.*\.tmp
